{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38842","headline":"赠李镡 · 杜荀鹤","name":"赠李镡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君行君文天合知，见君如此我兴悲。\n秪残三口兵戈後，才到孤村雨雪时。\n着卧衣裳难办洗，旋求粮食莫供炊。\n地鑪不暖柴枝湿，犹把蒙求授小儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}